custom DialogueManager singleton with the following API:  await DialogueManager.say("Speaker", "Text", optional_color, optional_auto_advance)Features include typewriter text effect (30 chars/sec, 120 when holding Space), speaker color presets for all characters, Space-to-advance input, and auto-advance mode for system messages. The system is always available through a CanvasLayer on layer 100.4.3. Market Economy AlgorithmsThe "Market Game" utilizes a sinusoidal pricing algorithm to simulate supply and demand.Formula: Price(t) = Base + (Seasonality * sin(t)) + (Player_Action * Impact_Factor).Inter-Chapter Connectivity: If the player purchases a surplus of "Red Potions" in Oakhaven (Chapter 1), the Global_Shortage flag is triggered. In Chapter 2 (Ironhold), potion prices increase by 20%, forcing the player to engage with the crafting system instead.4.3. Asset Sourcing Reference TableKingdomAsset Pack NameSourceUsageOakhavenSprout LandsItch.ioVillage Tiles/UIOakhavenMystic WoodsItch.ioForest EnvironmentOakhavenPixel Art Slime MonstersItch.ioCommon EnemiesIronholdSteampunk RPG TilesetItch.ioInterior LevelsIronholdIndustrial TilesetOpenGameArtFactory LevelsIronholdSteampunk Bot Enemy PackItch.ioArachnid EnemiesEnd of Execution Log.Compiled by Lead Narrative Systems Architect.Project Runtime: Apotheosis Production Archive.